"People at all levels have been doing football for a very long time and they are awaiting the chairman will be acquainted on Thursday."
"They feel that it is high time for someone to lead the association," says the man, who is associated primarily with the Jablonec club, but who has worked in Sparta and the executive committee of the association for many years.
That's why he thinks he's had enough experience to be able to manage Czech football.
