We also have to add to the previous experience from the national Spanish team during complicated knock-out matches for the European and world championships.
Costa Rican players, on the contrary, have very limited opportunities for foreign matches in the area. There is, for example, the Concacaf, which is considered to be the lowest level within FIFA.
